  m_text: Ghoulaxy is a tower defense game that tells the tale of ghosts and the
    stars. Ghosts typically come out at night, as they enjoy the dark, yet stars
    come out each night to light the way... and the ghosts do not like that. Because
    of this, the ghosts must fight off the invading stars in order to protect the
    sanctity of their home cemetery!
