  m_text: 'Occasionally slows down all stars within its radius. Works well to stall
    for other attacking ghosts to do more damage. Can also be used to stall out individual
    rounds to make the most out of your Reapers.


    Cost: 50e

    Damage: 0 /
    3 sec

    Range Radius: 2.5 tiles

    Lifetime: 48 sec

    Slow Percentage: 
    60%

    Slow Duration: 2 sec'
